  "description": "DependentValidationBlazor is a netstandard2.0 library that extends the System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations with conditional attributes based on another property of the validated object.\n      Originaly made by Angelo Rotta, this library is a fork of the original project that was made to be compatible with Blazor.\n      The new attributes are the following:\n\n      - RequiredIf\n      - RequiredIfEmpty\n      - RequiredIfFalse\n      - RequiredIfNot\n      - RequiredIfNotEmpty\n      - RequiredIfNotRegExMatch\n      - RequiredIfRegExMatch\n      - RequiredIfTrue\n      - RegularExpressionIf\n      - Is\n      - EqualTo\n      - GreaterThan\n      - GreaterThanOrEqualTo\n      - LessThan\n      - LessThanOrEqualTo\n      - NotEqualTo",
  "id": "DependentValidationBlazor",
